# GitHub Linguist Language Override Configuration
# By default, GitHub classifies .sql as "data" and hides it from the repository language bar.
# linguist-detectable=true forces GitHub Linguist to track and display SQL in the language breakdown.

*.sql linguist-detectable=true
*.sql linguist-language=SQL

*.py linguist-detectable=true
*.py linguist-language=Python

*.js linguist-detectable=true
*.js linguist-language=JavaScript
